{"type": "pair", "at": "2026-11-27T01:55:42+00:00", "step": "advocate-20261127T015407Z", "issue": "whu-lean-orch-t1-q1-01d", "kind": "advocate", "seed": 149991828990768, "ruling_id": "1e5dce7d6971261f", "prompt_sha256": "388a27cee450b3cd27c5dfc394cb63f39bfda40016ac6df96c67d1958d57ac11", "inputs_sha256": "46494fae1be8f6b82e4466a4b3f4afed1e2151aaee24f7c67161fc6844107b86", "first": {"ruling": "amend", "text": "Compared with non-digital targeted client communication (e.g. pamphlets), digital targeted client communication via mobile devices may have little or no effect on exclusive breastfeeding (RR 0.92, 95% CI 0.79 to 1.07) and may reduce 'any maternal health problem' reported up to 10 days postpartum (RR 0.19, 95% CI 0.04 to 0.79) (low-certainty evidence); its effect on health service use, and for some other groups of participants on any outcome, is unknown because no studies reported it [3]."}, "second": {"ruling": "amend", "text": "For some populations in the review, no studies compared digital targeted client communication via mobile devices with non-digital targeted client communication, so the effect is unknown. In another population, digital targeted communication may have little or no effect on exclusive breastfeeding compared with non-digital communication such as pamphlets (RR 0.92, 95% CI 0.79 to 1.07; low-certainty evidence), and the effect on health service use is unknown because of a lack of studies [3]."}, "usable": true, "agree_decision": true, "agree": false, "usage": {"input": 1751, "output": 712, "usd": 0.021244, "seconds": 7.1}, "applied": false}
{"type": "pair", "at": "2026-11-27T01:55:47+00:00", "step": "advocate-20261127T015407Z", "issue": "whu-lean-orch-t1-q1-01d", "kind": "advocate", "seed": 149991828990768, "ruling_id": "dc00c2c28774f00a", "prompt_sha256": "388a27cee450b3cd27c5dfc394cb63f39bfda40016ac6df96c67d1958d57ac11", "inputs_sha256": "cc7567fc907c5db3a19aeff86043ecd0a02242e4736ee32403b29775aa879dcf", "first": {"ruling": "amend", "text": "For adult populations, no study measured the impact of this intervention compared with standard care on sexually transmitted infection (STI) rates, so its effect on that outcome is unknown for this comparison [4]."}, "second": {"ruling": "amend", "text": "In adult populations, no study measured the impact of this intervention versus standard care on sexually transmitted infection (STI) rates, so its effect on that outcome is unknown for that comparison [4]."}, "usable": true, "agree_decision": true, "agree": false, "usage": {"input": 1753, "output": 494, "usd": 0.016892, "seconds": 4.6}, "applied": false}
{"type": "pair", "at": "2026-11-27T01:55:53+00:00", "step": "advocate-20261127T015407Z", "issue": "whu-lean-orch-t1-q1-01d", "kind": "advocate", "seed": 149991828990768, "ruling_id": "dff1bdf790900fd1", "prompt_sha256": "388a27cee450b3cd27c5dfc394cb63f39bfda40016ac6df96c67d1958d57ac11", "inputs_sha256": "6b06c5b32ebf40acf1dc57b8403a2af100bd064139b84304d7812291802e2b53", "first": {"ruling": "amend", "text": "For targeted client communication via mobile devices (TCCMD) versus non-digital targeted client communication, no studies reported STI rates, condom use, ART adherence, abortion rates, or contraceptive use; TCCMD may modestly increase service attendance overall (RR 1.12, 95% CI 0.92 to 1.35; low-certainty evidence), though the confidence interval encompasses benefit and harm [4]."}, "second": {"ruling": "amend", "text": "For targeted client communication on mobile devices versus non-digital targeted client communication, no studies reported STI rates, condom use, ART adherence, abortion rates, or contraceptive use, so effects on these outcomes are unknown; targeted communication on mobile devices may modestly increase service attendance overall (RR 1.12, 95% CI 0.92 to 1.35; low-certainty evidence), though the confidence interval encompasses both benefit and harm [4]."}, "usable": true, "agree_decision": true, "agree": false, "usage": {"input": 1920, "output": 625, "usd": 0.02018, "seconds": 5.8}, "applied": false}
{"type": "pair", "at": "2026-11-27T01:55:55+00:00", "step": "advocate-20261127T015407Z", "issue": "whu-lean-orch-t1-q1-01d", "kind": "advocate", "seed": 149991828990768, "ruling_id": "6dff00fb494dbac1", "prompt_sha256": "388a27cee450b3cd27c5dfc394cb63f39bfda40016ac6df96c67d1958d57ac11", "inputs_sha256": "cc3f3ef4b51a6aa2e9fb7a194d0d881c14c6e4c924a7b72fa753595a705f692b", "first": {"ruling": "reject", "text": null}, "second": {"ruling": "reject", "text": null}, "usable": true, "agree_decision": true, "agree": true, "usage": {"input": 2302, "output": 95, "usd": 0.011108, "seconds": 1.4}, "applied": false}
